ion for central venous catheter insertion for incoming residents in anesthesiology: a prospective and randomized study. BMC Med Educ 2022;22:357. 10.1186/s12909-022-03437-0 [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 18. Kejela E, Tesfaye G, Getachew A, et al. Evaluation of knowledge, attitudes, and practice in an online faculty development course for anesthesia educators in East Africa. J Contin Educ Health Prof 2023;43:274–8. 10.1097/CEH.0000000000000493 [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 19. Moquin R, Dewey M, Weinhold A, et al. The flipped classroom approach in a pediatric anesthesiology fellowship curriculum. Cureus 2023;15:e43979. 10.7759/cureus.43979 [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 20. Ødegaard NB, Myrhaug HT, Dahl-Michelsen T, et al. Digital learning designs in physiotherapy education: a systematic review and meta-analysis. BMC Med Educ 2021;21:48. 10.1186/s12909-020-02483-w [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 21. Li B-Z, Cao N-W, Ren C-X, et al. Flipped classroom improves nursing students'' theoretical learning in China: a meta-analysis. PLoS One 2020;15:e0237926. 10.1371/journal.pone.0237926 [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 22. Xu P, Chen Y, Nie W, et al. The effectiveness of a flipped classroom on the development of Chinese nursing students'' skill competence: a systematic review and meta-analysis. Nurse Educ Today 2019;80:67–77. 10.1016/j.nedt.2019.06.005 [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 23. Gillette C, Rudolph M, Kimble C, et al. A meta-analysis of outcomes comparing flipped classroom and lecture. Am J Pharm Educ 2018;82:6898. 10.5688/ajpe6898 [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 24. Hew KF, Lo CK. Flipped classroom improves student learning in health professions education: a meta-analysis. BMC Med Educ 2018;18:38. 10.1186/s12909-018-1144-z [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] Associated Data This section collect